---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Request received
permalink: /thank-you/
noindex: true
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
{% from "partials/icons.njk" import icon %}
<section class="section">
  <div class="container prose">
    <h1>Thank you. Your request has been sent.</h1>
    <p>The clinic will call you on the number you gave to confirm the date and time of your appointment. Clinic hours are {{ site.hours | lower }}.</p>
    <p>If you asked for a video consultation, the video call details will be shared with you when your appointment is confirmed.</p>
    <p>If your appointment is urgent, or you haven’t heard back within one working day, please call or send a WhatsApp message.</p>
    <div class="button-row">
      <a class="btn btn-whatsapp" href="{{ site.whatsapp | whatsappLink(site.whatsappMessage) }}">{{ icon("whatsapp") }}WhatsApp</a>
      <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="{{ site.phone | telLink }}">{{ icon("phone") }}Call {{ site.phoneDisplay }}</a>
      <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/">Back to home page</a>
    </div>
    <p class="form-note">In a medical emergency, go to the nearest hospital emergency department.</p>
  </div>
</section>
